WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.671
"Oh no!" Gasser said.

2
00:00:08.671 --> 00:00:14.866
A broken statue lay under him.

3
00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:19.760
"I'm sorry," Gasser said.

4
00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:24.062
"I was looking at the dirt.

5
00:00:24.063 --> 00:00:28.304
I didn't see the statue."

6
00:00:28.312 --> 00:00:32.072
"That's okay," Grandma said.

7
00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:39.615
"No big deal," Carlin said.

8
00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:46.100
"There is more to see!" Grandma said.

9
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:54.735
Everyone followed her.

10
00:00:54.735 --> 00:01:01.264
Smoosh!

11
00:01:01.264 --> 00:01:04.454
"Uh-oh," Poppy said.

12
00:01:04.454 --> 00:01:10.363
"Gasser ran over some flowers!"

13
00:01:10.363 --> 00:01:14.478
"Please be careful!" Dipper whispered.

14
00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:18.779
"Sorry," Gasser said.

15
00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:23.608
"Don't worry," Eddy said.

16
00:01:23.609 --> 00:01:28.683
"We know you didn't mean to."

17
00:01:28.684 --> 00:01:32.485
"I like this fountain," Jeb said.

18
00:01:32.486 --> 00:01:35.718
"It looks like a boat."

19
00:01:35.718 --> 00:01:39.313
"This way," Carlin said.

20
00:01:39.313 --> 00:01:44.130
Everyone followed.

21
00:01:44.131 --> 00:01:46.561
Clunk!

22
00:01:46.562 --> 00:01:51.825
"Ugh!" Gasser cried.

23
00:01:51.826 --> 00:01:56.404
"My tire knocked over the fountain!"

24
00:01:56.404 --> 00:02:03.879
He backed into a sign. Smash!

25
00:02:03.879 --> 00:02:07.378
"I'm too big!" Gasser cried.

26
00:02:07.379 --> 00:02:12.889
"I'm ruining the garden!"

